# syntek-base only — this file is copier-excluded, so a generated project never receives it.
#
# The maps here chart work on the TEMPLATE itself. Each one says so in its own header and
# is deleted once its epic ships, so none of them belongs in the template's git history.
# A generated project's feature maps are real artefacts of `01-feature` and are tracked
# normally — which is why this rule must not travel with the template.
MAP-*.md

# The map template ships; it is the shape every real map is written from.
!MAP-000-TEMPLATE.md
